  "summaries": {
    "en": "ATB management, Synergy Action timing, Materia loadouts, and open-world region completion strategy for Final Fantasy VII Rebirth.",
    "ja": "ATB管理、シナジーアクションのタイミング、マテリアセッティング、オープンワールドのリージョン完了戦略を解説するFF7リバース攻略ガイド。"
  },
  "category": "jrpg",
  "difficulty": "intermediate",
  "thumbnail": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop",
  "keyPoints": {
    "en": [
      "ATB charges are shared across all party members via the Active Cross Battle system—when one character idles, their ATB feeds into the shared pool for other characters' ability costs. Minimise idle time on all three party members simultaneously.",
      "Stagger Gauge fills faster from abilities that match the enemy's stagger type: physical pressure staggerers (Punisher Mode, Counterstrike) versus elemental burst staggerers (Magnify+Fire, Thunder Materia). Always identify stagger type before committing to an approach.",
      "Synergy Skills do not cost ATB and can be activated mid-combo. The Cloud+Aerith Synergy (Whirling Uppercut) staggers instantly without meeting gauge requirements—use it as an emergency interrupt against charge attacks.",
      "Materia inheritance through the Chadley World Intel system provides fully upgraded Materia earlier than crafting allows. Complete 3–4 Intel objectives per region before proceeding to unlock free tier-2 Magic Materia.",
      "Open-world Summon Crystals are unlocked region by region via Chadley's Battle Simulator. Completing all Combat Simulator battles in a region grants the region's Summon Crystal—prioritise Titan (Grasslands) and Bahamut Arisen (Costa del Sol) first."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "ATBチャージはアクティブクロスバトルシステムで全メンバーが共有する。1キャラがアイドル状態になると、そのATBが他キャラのアビリティコスト向けに共有プールに流れる。3名のアイドル時間を同時に最小化する。",
      "スタッガーゲージはスタッガータイプに対応したアビリティで早く溜まる。物理プレッシャー型（パニッシャーモード、カウンター攻撃）と属性バースト型（拡散+ファイア、サンダーマテリア）で異なる。アプローチを決める前に必ずタイプを特定する。",
      "シナジースキルはATBを消費せずコンボ途中でも発動できる。クラウド+エアリスのシナジー（旋風昇龍撃）はゲージ条件なしで即時スタッガーを起こすため、チャージ攻撃への緊急割り込みに使える。",
      "チャドリーのワールドインテルシステム経由のマテリア継承で、クラフト可能時期より早く強化済みマテリアが手に入る。各地域でインテル目標3〜4個を進めてから次に進み、無料のティア2マジックマテリアを解放する。",
      "オープンワールドの召喚クリスタルはチャドリーのバトルシミュレーターで地域ごとに解放される。地域内の全シミュレーターバトルを完了すると地域の召喚クリスタルが手に入る。タイタン（草原地帯）とバハムート・アライズン（コスタ・デル・ソル）を優先する。"
    ]
  },
  "opening": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Early Party ATB Fundamentals",
        "body": "The first 3 story chapters teach ATB rotation fundamentals. Key habit to build immediately: cycle through all three active party members every 4–5 seconds using the directional pad even when not inputting commands. This prevents ATB from stalling on a single character and distributes gauge pressure across the team. Tifa's ATB generation rate is 15% faster than Cloud's at equivalent level, making her the best ATB \"charger\" for party-wide ability casting."
      },
      {
        "title": "Grasslands Region Intel Priority",
        "body": "The Grasslands region has the densest World Intel to story area ratio in the game. Complete all 12 Intel objectives before leaving the region—they include the Titan Summon Crystal and 3 full Materia upgrade slots. The Proto-Relic questline in this region takes 25–35 minutes but rewards the only source of the AP Up Materia available before Junon, which doubles AP gain for the next 10 hours of play."
      }
    ]
  },
  "midGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Stagger Burst Optimisation",
        "body": "Once an enemy is staggered, damage dealt is multiplied by 1.6× base. Increase this multiplier further: Aerith's Ray of Judgment spell amplifies stagger multiplier by an additional +0.4 during the cast animation. Stack Cloud's Focused Thrust (pressures physical stagger) with Aerith's Ray of Judgment and Tifa's combo finishers to reach a 2.4× stagger multiplier, which is the practical cap for most non-boss encounters. Barret's Overcharge ability extends stagger duration by 30%, giving more time to execute the burst cycle."
      },
      {
        "title": "Materia Loadout for Exploration",
        "body": "Maintain two loadout presets: a combat preset and an exploration preset. Combat preset: Fire/Ice (or applicable element) + Magnify + ATB Boost + Healing on all 3 party members. Exploration preset: Assess + Steal + Gil Up + Chocobo Lure (swap between characters as needed). The Assess Materia is mandatory for all encounters against new enemy types—assessing unlocks enemy Intel in Chadley's database and reveals weaknesses permanently for future encounters."
      },
      {
        "title": "Open World Region Order",
        "body": "After Junon, complete regions in this order for the smoothest difficulty curve: Junon Outskirts → Corel Region → Gongaga Region → Cosmo Canyon → Nibel Region → Final Story Area. Completing Gongaga before Cosmo Canyon is important because Gongaga's region rewards include Materia upgrades that significantly improve the Cosmo Canyon dungeon's encounter clearance speed. Prioritise Chadley objectives over side quests in each region—Summon Crystals from Chadley outweigh most side quest rewards in combat utility."
      },
      {
        "title": "Synergy Action Timing Reference",
        "body": "Each character pair has a unique Synergy Action unlocked through Bond of Friendship. The most effective combinations: Cloud+Tifa (Synergy: Limit Break gauge fill) for boss burst windows; Aerith+Red XIII (Synergy: AoE elemental field) for crowd control; Barret+Cloud (Synergy: physical stagger pressure) for tanky enemies. Synergy Actions recharge on a 60-second timer; reset the timer by changing the active character rather than waiting passively."
      }
    ]
  },
  "endGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Combat Simulator Hard Mode Preparation",
        "body": "Hard Mode disables item use during combat. Build your preparation loop around pre-battle HP and MP restoration through inn rests (only method of full restoration in Hard Mode). Maintain Revitalize Materia on two characters at all times—it replaces items for status recovery. The final Hard Mode Simulator battles (Chadley Tier 3+) require builds that maximise ATB generation speed rather than raw damage, as the encounter timer is the primary constraint."
      },
      {
        "title": "Final Chapter Checklist",
        "body": "Before entering the final chapter area, complete: all 6 region Summon Crystals (provides Ifrit, Shiva, Ramuh, Titan, Leviathan, Bahamut Arisen as summon options), max Materia AP on all loadout Materia, and at least 3 Manuscript collectibles per character (unlocks SP for exclusive passive skills). The final boss sequence has 4 phases with no party swap opportunity—set party composition in the chapter select menu, not mid-dungeon."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mistakes": {
    "en": [
      "Letting ATB stall on idle characters—the shared ATB pool only fills from active characters performing actions; an idle character at full ATB is wasting potential casting capacity for the whole team.",
      "Using items on Hard Mode before reading the difficulty description—Hard Mode disables all items including Phoenix Downs; running out of Revitalize Materia coverage in a Hard Mode encounter has no recovery option.",
      "Skipping Assess Materia use against new enemies—assessment unlocks permanent weakness data in Chadley's enemy database, and the data carries across all future encounters with that enemy type throughout the game.",
      "Missing Chadley World Intel quests before region transitions—Intel objectives in earlier regions are permanently unavailable after the story moves past that region without a chapter select replay.",
      "Ignoring Synergy Skill meter—Synergy Skills have a separate visual indicator that turns gold when a Synergy Action becomes available. Missing the activation window wastes the free stagger or Limit Break gauge fill opportunity."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "アイドルキャラクターのATBを溜めたままにする。共有ATBプールはアクションを実行中のキャラクターのみから補充され、満タンでアイドル状態のキャラクターはチーム全体の潜在的な発動容量を無駄にしている。",
      "ハードモードで難易度説明を読まずにアイテムを使おうとする。ハードモードはフェニックスの尾も含む全アイテムを無効化する。ハードモードでリバイタ系マテリアがない状態での回復手段はない。",
      "新しい敵にアサインマテリアを使わない。アサインはチャドリーの図鑑に永続的な弱点データを解放し、ゲーム全体でその敵タイプとの全戦闘に引き継がれる。",
      "リージョン移行前にチャドリーのワールドインテルクエストを取り逃す。以前のリージョンのインテル目標はストーリーが進行した後、チャプターセレクトなしでは永久に利用不可になる。",
      "シナジースキルメーターを無視する。シナジースキルはシナジーアクションが利用可能になると金色に変わる独立したビジュアルインジケーターを持つ。発動ウィンドウを逃すと、無料スタッガーやリミットブレイクゲージ補充の機会を失う。"
    ]
  },
